# Trivy misconfiguration findings that are deliberate for this deployment.
# Each entry is a design decision, not an oversight — revisit if the
# architecture changes.

# Public ALB in public subnets is the ingress point by design.
AVD-AWS-0053
AVD-AWS-0164

# Unrestricted egress: the broker must reach arbitrary vault backends and
# webhook targets; outbound is filtered by the application (url_guard), not
# the security group.
AVD-AWS-0104

# Aurora storage_encrypted=true with the AWS-managed key. A CMK is a
# per-deployment choice, not a chart default.
AVD-AWS-0079
